  "body": "## Overview (Phase F4: P11–P12)\nImplements Major Phase F4 capabilities for TokTickIT Lab 3 (Work Packages P11 and P12):\n- **P11 (Administrator User Management):**\n  - Administrative User REST APIs: `GET /api/admin/users`, `POST /api/admin/users`, `PATCH /api/admin/users/:id`, and `POST /api/admin/users/:id/initial-password`.\n  - Administrative Safety Invariants:\n    - **Self-Deactivation Guard (BR-19):** Blocks administrator from deactivating their own account (HTTP 400 `SELF_DEACTIVATION`).\n    - **Last Active Admin Guard (BR-20):** Blocks deactivating or demoting the last active administrator (HTTP 400 `LAST_ACTIVE_ADMIN`).\n    - **Owner Deactivation Cascade (BR-21):** Automatically unassigns tickets (`ownerId: null`), increments `version`, and returns `unassignedTicketsCount` when an owner is deactivated or demoted.\n    - **Session Revocation (AC-53):** Purges all active sessions upon role change, deactivation, or password reset.\n  - Frontend Screen 5 (`UserManagement.tsx`): Full user directory with debounced search, role filter, responsive table, Add User modal, Edit User modal (with disabled self-deactivation and last-admin warning), and Reset Password modal with session revocation warning.\n- **P12 (Integrated Verification & Visual Evidence):**\n  - Full Playwright E2E verification across Desktop (1280x800), Tablet (768x1024), and Mobile (375x667) viewports.\n  - Automated visual screenshots captured to `artifacts/lab-03/screenshots/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Covered\n- **AC-20 to AC-27:** Admin user list, search, filter, and user provisioning with forced password change.\n- **AC-32 to AC-35:** Admin user editing and administrative password reset.\n- **AC-49 to AC-56:** Integrated system verification, multi-viewport UI responsiveness, and session invalidation.\n- **BR-19, BR-20, BR-21:** Self-deactivation, last active admin protection, and owner cascade unassignment.\n\n## Verification Results\n- **Full Server Test Suite:** 25 files, 246/246 tests passed (0 failed, 0 skipped) in 43.7s.\n- **Full Client Test Suite:** 15 files, 80/80 tests passed (0 failed, 0 skipped) in 19.5s.\n- **Full Lab 3 Playwright E2E Suite:** 4 spec files, 69/69 tests passed across Desktop, Tablet, and Mobile in 1.6m.\n- **Production Builds:** Server (`tsc`) and Client (`tsc && vite build`) compiled with 0 errors.\n\n> **Note on Branching Contract:** This PR targets `lab3-staging`. As required by project rules, Issue #42 is explicitly linked in the Development panel below.",
